        }
      ],
      "title": "魔王计划·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "24480001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇，刚才是瞬间移动吗？好厉害！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24480002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "没错，那正是我的能力。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24480003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "虽然人家的能力确实非常方便，但是和姐姐大人比还是有很长的一段距离呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24480004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "你们知道其他关押手办的监狱在什么地方吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24480005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你打算做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24480006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "既然已经被牵扯进来了，那么我就绝对不会坐视不管。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24480007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "黑子也是这么觉得的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24480008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我们也正有这个打算呢，大家一起行动吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24480009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "牙牙",
          "text": "大、大大大大事不好！有俘虏逃出来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24480010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "看来要优先解决一下这边的麻烦呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24490001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "这里就是关押大家的地方吗……好大的动静，里面是什么情况？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24490002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "黑子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24490003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "交给我吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24500001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "朋克小子",
          "text": "不要再挣扎了！乖乖躺下会比较轻松哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24500002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "又想吃盖火锅了吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24500003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "源上",
          "text": "风魔手里剑！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24500004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "怎么回事？为什么手办们在自相残杀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24500005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "大、大家不要再打了啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24500006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "已经杀红眼了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24500007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪储蓄罐",
          "text": "救……救命！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24500008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "看来需要我们强势介入了啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-608",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
