      ],
      "title": "魔王计划·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "24550001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "小鬼，你不是想要成为驰名世界的超级大魔王吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "那就只需要听从我们的安排就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你才是小鬼！叫我大王！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "总之，后面的事不需要你操心了，你只要负责把人抓来。\n剩下的事情和你没关系了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你这家伙，居然用这种语气和我说话，是在小看我吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "让我辛辛苦苦抓来的手办自相残杀，就是你们想到的方法？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我刚才已经解释过了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我不认可你们的方案，你被炒鱿鱼了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "说什么会帮我出谋划策，果然你和那个花言巧语的女人，都只是想利用我罢了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我已经失去耐心了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "所以说，我最讨厌小鬼了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你、你想干嘛？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "既然已经不需要你了，当然是把你清理掉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "大、大胆，你以为本王是软柿子吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24550017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "好、好！就让你瞧瞧本王的厉害！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
